--- access ---
1. Training set is open-access (ODC-By) at https://physionet.org/content/challenge-2018/1.0.0/
2. Subset download (recommended): python scripts/download_cinc2018_subset.py --max-subjects 24
3. Export: python scripts/export_edf.py --dataset cinc2018 --input-dir data/raw/cinc2018 --output-dir data/cinc2018 --validate
